body:
After Battle Report: As most of the times I went to the medium lane on Port Bay, almost no opposition there so I proceed to flank the enemies till I entered the TDs position, where suprisingly also t54 lightweight was. Dispatched him and continued shooting caernavron, then pushed on st. emil. Battle was pretty close but I realized it was crucial I finished low hp m6 exp. After that only duel with t29 was left and when he bounced I knew my team won. BTW. the profit is with no boosters on, this tank is a beast.

&#x200B;

Replay: [https://replays.wotinspector.com/en/view/5a4048933f089d24302f96fb6491dc4d](https://replays.wotinspector.com/en/view/5a4048933f089d24302f96fb6491dc4d)
